WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

00:07.040 --> 00:08.920
‎SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:35.680 --> 01:38.920
‎ADAPTED FROM ‎JIA JIN CHAI‎, ORIGINAL NOVEL
‎BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:49.680 --> 01:50.920
Help!

01:51.520 --> 01:53.040
Help!

01:54.440 --> 01:56.320
Somebody!

01:56.400 --> 01:58.240
Is anyone there? Help!

02:02.360 --> 02:04.160
-Put out the fire!
-Help!

02:04.240 --> 02:05.840
-Hurry!
-Help!

02:05.920 --> 02:07.360
-Put out the fire!
-Help!

02:07.440 --> 02:08.280
Hurry!

02:10.120 --> 02:12.280
Hurry! Hurry!

02:12.360 --> 02:13.120
BOOK PAVILION

02:13.200 --> 02:14.680
Put out the fire!

02:14.760 --> 02:15.920
Hurry!

02:16.000 --> 02:17.160
-Hurry!
-Come on!

02:17.240 --> 02:18.160
Hurry!

02:18.680 --> 02:20.320
Over here! Hurry!

02:20.400 --> 02:21.560
-Grandmother.
-This…

02:21.640 --> 02:23.800
If you still see me as your grandmother,

02:23.880 --> 02:24.920
-then shut your mouth right now.
-Over here!

02:25.000 --> 02:25.880
Hurry up!

02:25.960 --> 02:27.840
Hurry! Break that lock!

02:28.440 --> 02:29.800
-Get her out!
-Quick!

02:38.760 --> 02:39.840
This way!

02:39.920 --> 02:40.760
Hurry!

02:43.200 --> 02:44.840
Hurry!

02:45.560 --> 02:47.400
Why are there two Lady Raos?

02:49.120 --> 02:50.080
You may all leave.

03:00.160 --> 03:01.800
I was just about to tell you, Grandmother.

03:02.560 --> 03:04.400
I was foolish and stubborn.

03:04.480 --> 03:06.040
I tried to take my own life
before the wedding.

03:06.640 --> 03:08.160
Aunt Heng'e felt sorry for me.

03:08.240 --> 03:09.720
She feared forcing me
to marry into the Lu family

03:09.800 --> 03:11.280
would only lead to disaster.

03:11.360 --> 03:14.120
So she went to great lengths to find
this woman to take my place.

03:14.200 --> 03:16.000
It was only meant to be temporary.

03:16.080 --> 03:18.880
But Aunt Heng'e kept trying to persuade me
and made me see what was at stake.

03:18.960 --> 03:20.560
Only then did I realize
my terrible mistake.

03:20.640 --> 03:22.080
I deeply regretted it.

03:22.160 --> 03:23.920
I'd long wanted to go to
the Duke's Residence and beg forgiveness.

03:27.160 --> 03:29.080
Mother, don't blame her.

03:29.160 --> 03:30.800
It was me. I didn't let her go.

03:31.480 --> 03:33.040
Lord Lu was still ill,

03:33.120 --> 03:34.800
and the Lu family was in turmoil.

03:34.880 --> 03:36.360
If they learned the truth,

03:36.960 --> 03:39.640
instead of bringing Lord Lu luck,
it might cost his life.

03:39.720 --> 03:41.720
That would've been a grave sin, Mother.

03:42.320 --> 03:43.960
When we heard Lord Lu had recovered,

03:44.760 --> 03:46.520
I was overjoyed.

03:46.600 --> 03:49.920
I planned
to secretly switch back during this visit.

03:50.000 --> 03:53.440
But this woman wanted the wealth
and status of the Lu family.

03:53.520 --> 03:55.560
She threatened to tell everyone
the whole truth.

03:55.640 --> 03:58.480
I had no choice but to lock her up.

03:58.560 --> 04:01.520
Humiliated and furious,
she started hurling vile accusations,

04:01.600 --> 04:03.520
threatening to ruin the Wei family's name!

04:05.240 --> 04:07.160
I panicked, so I…

04:07.880 --> 04:11.680
Grandmother, I was wrong. I was wrong.

04:11.760 --> 04:13.120
Every word is a lie!

04:14.040 --> 04:17.560
An orphan girl
has no right to threaten a noble lady.

04:17.640 --> 04:20.120
You were clearly trying to burn me alive!

04:35.840 --> 04:36.880
Mother.

04:39.960 --> 04:43.320
A life was at stake. How could you dare?

04:46.320 --> 04:47.200
You knew about this too?

04:48.880 --> 04:50.960
I was too timid to tell you.

04:52.080 --> 04:54.720
Fine.

04:54.800 --> 04:56.880
So you all pulled off
this whole deception,

04:57.880 --> 05:00.400
and I was the only one kept in the dark.

05:01.000 --> 05:04.560
Do you have any respect for me at all?

05:06.160 --> 05:08.240
Mother, we're family.

05:08.320 --> 05:11.320
No matter how badly we've erred,
we share one fate.

05:11.400 --> 05:12.320
If one falls, we all suffer.

05:12.920 --> 05:15.640
Lord Lu is here right now.

05:16.240 --> 05:17.760
If he hears even a word of this,

05:17.840 --> 05:20.120
there'll be serious trouble.

05:20.200 --> 05:21.440
For the Wei family's
century-old good name,

05:21.520 --> 05:24.000
this must not get out.

05:32.920 --> 05:35.200
Yes. The Wei family's good name
comes first.

05:35.280 --> 05:38.760
Mother can punish me
however you want later.

05:38.840 --> 05:40.560
But this woman cannot live.

05:40.640 --> 05:42.600
Keeping her alive
will only bring disaster.

05:44.640 --> 05:46.960
Mother, you're too merciful to do it.

05:47.480 --> 05:50.080
Then let me do it for you.

05:50.800 --> 05:52.600
Grandmother! Please!

05:52.680 --> 05:54.480
Save me! Please!

06:09.640 --> 06:10.800
Drag her out, now!

06:22.480 --> 06:23.320
My Lord!

06:23.960 --> 06:24.840
My Lord!

06:24.920 --> 06:26.760
Why the panic? Where is Rao?

06:29.680 --> 06:32.080
My Lady suddenly felt dizzy in the garden.

06:32.600 --> 06:35.280
I couldn't support her by myself,
so I hurried back for help.

06:39.800 --> 06:40.920
Dowager Lady!

06:43.720 --> 06:44.800
Dowager Lady.

06:45.800 --> 06:48.840
I'm just a helpless orphan
with no family, power, or status.

06:48.920 --> 06:52.000
The Wei family paid me 50,000 coins
to marry Lord Lu for luck,

06:52.080 --> 06:54.560
and spend my life
widowed in Lady Rao's place.

06:55.560 --> 06:58.280
We agreed that from then on,
fate would decide my life,

06:58.360 --> 07:00.440
and the Wei family would stay out of it.

07:00.520 --> 07:03.440
But Lord Lu survived.

07:03.520 --> 07:05.640
So they changed their minds.

07:06.240 --> 07:08.800
They tricked me here
and tried to kill me to keep me quiet.

07:09.800 --> 07:12.560
Dowager Lady, Lady Rao and I
may share a face,

07:13.160 --> 07:14.640
but we're nothing alike
in personalities or bearing.

07:14.720 --> 07:15.680
BOOK PAVILION

07:15.760 --> 07:17.520
Lord Lu is far too perceptive.

07:18.120 --> 07:19.240
He and I became a couple.

07:19.840 --> 07:21.760
We've spent every day and night together.

07:21.840 --> 07:23.280
How could he not know the difference?

07:23.960 --> 07:26.040
You… You've already shared his bed?

07:26.760 --> 07:28.040
That's impossible!

07:28.120 --> 07:29.360
Lu Zhuo only just recovered
from a grave illness.

07:29.440 --> 07:32.000
No matter how anxious the Duchess may be,

07:32.080 --> 07:34.520
would she really let her grandson
be intimate with a woman so soon?

07:35.120 --> 07:38.480
To save herself,
she'd tell any outrageous lie!

07:38.560 --> 07:40.680
Don't believe her. Don't!

07:42.440 --> 07:44.000
Newlyweds are always inseparable.

07:44.080 --> 07:46.160
We'll be living closely
as husband and wife.

07:47.080 --> 07:48.920
How many moles I have on my body…

07:49.440 --> 07:51.320
How could my own husband not know?

07:53.800 --> 07:54.800
Shameless!

07:56.760 --> 08:00.600
Grandmother, she became Lady Wei Rao
and Lord Lu's wife.

08:00.680 --> 08:03.240
Then what about me?
Who am I supposed to be?

08:04.560 --> 08:07.600
I won't even be able to show my face
in public again.

08:08.800 --> 08:11.320
You've always loved me most.

08:11.400 --> 08:14.840
Can you really bear to see me
ruined for life, Grandmother?

08:16.040 --> 08:19.040
I was wrong. I know I was wrong.
I don't want her dead anymore.

08:19.640 --> 08:22.120
I only want to take back
my rightful place.

08:22.200 --> 08:25.360
If Lu Zhuo really finds out,
I'll go confess myself.

08:25.960 --> 08:27.520
I'll kneel and beg the Lu family.

08:27.600 --> 08:29.800
They're a noble and distinguished family.

08:29.880 --> 08:33.360
Would they really rather have
a woman who emptied chamber pots than me?

08:34.640 --> 08:36.880
She gave up more than just her husband.

08:37.720 --> 08:40.919
She even gave away the name
her own father gave her.

08:41.000 --> 08:44.159
How is Rao supposed to live, Mother?

08:45.720 --> 08:48.320
Mother, you've always
treasured Rao above all else.

08:48.400 --> 08:50.560
You've cherished her for 18 years.

08:51.280 --> 08:54.680
Can you really bear
to make her hide for the rest of her life,

08:54.760 --> 08:57.000
never able to show her face again?

09:15.520 --> 09:18.120
You showed no fear when plotting this.

09:19.120 --> 09:22.320
And when you tried to silence me,
you didn't hesitate for a second.

09:23.200 --> 09:24.600
From beginning to end,

09:24.680 --> 09:26.680
you showed the Dowager Lady
no respect at all.

09:27.560 --> 09:29.120
Dowager Lady, you know right from wrong.

09:29.200 --> 09:31.320
You can clearly see
who's right and who's wrong.

09:31.400 --> 09:37.040
I'm only an orphan asking you
to do what's best and give me justice.

09:42.440 --> 09:45.240
You… All of you… This…

09:45.320 --> 09:47.880
Dowager Lady! Dowager Lady!

09:48.400 --> 09:51.640
For some reason, Lord Lu
is heading straight for the back garden.

09:52.840 --> 09:55.840
Grandmother,
please grant Rao this one wish.

09:55.920 --> 09:58.640
From now on, I'll obey your every word
and never defy you again.

09:58.720 --> 10:00.320
I'll devote myself to my husband

10:00.400 --> 10:01.840
and be a worthy principal wife
of the Duke's Residence.

10:02.440 --> 10:04.640
I'll never make you worry
or feel disappointed again.

10:05.240 --> 10:08.360
Mother, my brother
is watching from heaven.

10:08.960 --> 10:13.680
He's watching how the Wei family
treats his own daughter.

10:14.760 --> 10:17.000
Have you forgotten the vow you made?

10:17.080 --> 10:19.720
You swore to protect,
cherish, and dote on her,

10:19.800 --> 10:23.120
and never let her suffer
the slightest wrong. Mother…

10:33.040 --> 10:35.280
Mother, decide quickly.

10:35.360 --> 10:37.000
We can't delay any longer.

10:47.320 --> 10:48.600
Take her away.

11:02.600 --> 11:05.280
My Lord, all the guests came to see you.

11:05.360 --> 11:06.240
The others are manageable,

11:06.320 --> 11:08.280
but those nobles
are proving quite difficult.

11:08.360 --> 11:09.440
Please join us in the reception pavilion

11:09.520 --> 11:11.680
-and spare His Lordship the trouble.
-I can't go right now.

11:11.760 --> 11:12.800
Give my apologies to your lord.

11:12.880 --> 11:15.440
If you don't come,
I won't know what to tell His Lordship.

11:16.960 --> 11:18.480
Lord Lu! Lord Lu!

11:18.560 --> 11:19.560
My Lord!

11:19.640 --> 11:21.640
He seems to be heading toward
the Book Pavilion.

11:36.440 --> 11:37.520
What's wrong?

11:37.600 --> 11:39.280
I felt very dizzy just now.

11:40.400 --> 11:42.040
I went to rest against a tree

11:42.120 --> 11:44.480
and came across a little green snake.

11:45.000 --> 11:46.040
I'm fine now.

11:47.920 --> 11:49.680
-I'll take you to Begonia Court.
-No.

11:52.920 --> 11:54.000
I'm not going.

11:54.720 --> 11:56.160
Grandmother cares for me most.

11:56.680 --> 11:57.800
I don't want to frighten her.

12:00.800 --> 12:02.080
I'll head back first.

12:04.440 --> 12:06.160
Bitao, come help me.

12:17.040 --> 12:18.080
My Lord.

12:20.880 --> 12:22.000
Tell Old Madam Wei

12:22.520 --> 12:25.080
I'm feeling unwell and have returned to
the Duke's Residence to rest.

12:25.160 --> 12:27.120
-I'll visit again another day.
-Yes.

12:30.880 --> 12:31.920
Let's go.

12:35.640 --> 12:36.800
Let go of me!

12:37.360 --> 12:38.640
Let me go!

12:39.320 --> 12:40.360
-Let go!
-Lady Rao!

12:40.440 --> 12:41.280
Lady Rao, calm down!

12:41.360 --> 12:43.120
-Let me go!
-Lady Rao.

12:45.040 --> 12:46.200
Let go!

12:48.880 --> 12:50.360
-You may all leave.
-Rao.

12:52.600 --> 12:54.160
Quick, come untie her.

12:58.600 --> 13:00.000
-Rao.
-You're not my grandmother!

13:00.080 --> 13:01.240
What are you doing?

13:01.320 --> 13:02.160
-All these years,
-Rao!

13:02.240 --> 13:04.560
you kept saying you loved me most!

13:04.640 --> 13:06.600
-Lies! All lies!
-Rao!

13:06.680 --> 13:08.760
-Calm down!
-If you truly loved me,

13:08.840 --> 13:11.000
you wouldn't let some impostor
take my place,

13:11.080 --> 13:13.200
then turn around and tie up
your own granddaughter!

13:13.280 --> 13:15.560
-Rao.
-How can you be so heartless?

13:18.760 --> 13:19.680
Take her away.

13:23.480 --> 13:24.720
Stop.

13:29.120 --> 13:30.440
What's done can't be undone.

13:31.480 --> 13:32.640
This is fate.

13:33.480 --> 13:36.840
Whoever went through the wedding that day

13:37.880 --> 13:42.160
is the daughter
married out of the Wei Residence

13:42.920 --> 13:45.240
and my own granddaughter.

13:46.560 --> 13:49.120
If anyone else dares say otherwise,

13:50.640 --> 13:52.680
they'll be cast out of the Wei family!

13:52.760 --> 13:54.440
-Mother!
-Grandmother!

13:54.960 --> 13:56.680
-Grandmother!
-Mother!

13:59.840 --> 14:01.920
Wei Rao, clean yourself up.

14:02.880 --> 14:04.600
Go see your husband.

14:12.080 --> 14:13.480
Dowager Lady, I'll never forget

14:17.400 --> 14:18.760
your great kindness.

14:26.640 --> 14:27.720
Please return the golden hairpin.

14:41.240 --> 14:42.360
Rao.

14:42.440 --> 14:44.920
How can you speak
to Grandmother like that?

14:45.560 --> 14:47.240
Am I wrong?

14:49.560 --> 14:51.040
All these years,

14:52.000 --> 14:54.160
you kept me locked up like a prisoner

14:54.240 --> 14:56.200
just because you hated my mother.

14:56.720 --> 14:59.000
You hated that she remarried
right after Father died.

14:59.080 --> 15:00.600
Because of you,

15:01.120 --> 15:04.520
I couldn't see Mother growing up
or have anything to do with her family.

15:04.600 --> 15:06.840
Your precious treasure?

15:06.920 --> 15:09.800
I was nothing but a little dog you kept.

15:12.920 --> 15:14.640
You must hate me, don't you?

15:15.400 --> 15:17.840
Even looking at me must hurt, right?

15:18.480 --> 15:21.400
Yet you still had to raise me
and treat me well.

15:21.480 --> 15:23.800
Otherwise, you'd have failed
your son who died so young!

15:24.440 --> 15:25.720
Rao, that's enough!

15:25.800 --> 15:27.720
You're afraid people
will call you heartless.

15:27.800 --> 15:28.640
Rao!

15:29.560 --> 15:31.080
You're afraid they'll condemn you
behind your back.

15:31.160 --> 15:33.360
It's all an act. You're a hypocrite!

15:33.440 --> 15:34.480
Stop it!

15:35.400 --> 15:36.600
Mother!

15:38.800 --> 15:40.080
Please, stop.

15:40.160 --> 15:41.600
Rao, are you all right?

15:45.720 --> 15:46.680
Stop it.

15:50.680 --> 15:53.200
I struck a nerve, didn't I?

15:54.560 --> 15:57.760
You sided with an outsider
against your own granddaughter.

15:58.360 --> 16:01.280
Father won't rest in peace
after seeing this.

16:02.520 --> 16:04.080
I curse you.

16:04.640 --> 16:05.920
-I hate you!
-Rao!

16:06.600 --> 16:08.120
Will you please stop?

16:08.200 --> 16:09.160
Enough!

16:09.240 --> 16:11.400
Stop breaking your grandmother's heart!

16:14.920 --> 16:15.840
Mother.

16:16.520 --> 16:18.440
Please don't blame her
for feeling betrayed.

16:18.520 --> 16:20.440
But I don't understand either.

16:21.320 --> 16:23.400
Why would you do this?

16:24.640 --> 16:26.920
I spoiled you too much.

16:27.760 --> 16:30.920
I indulged you
until you forgot your place.

16:31.000 --> 16:33.760
You keep calling her a chamber-pot woman,

16:33.840 --> 16:35.320
but the truth is…

16:35.840 --> 16:38.800
You're nowhere near as clever as she is.

16:40.600 --> 16:44.600
Do you know what she told me in this room?

16:45.960 --> 16:50.160
Rao, get up. Please, get up.
The floor is cold.

17:12.560 --> 17:13.400
You…

17:14.680 --> 17:15.560
You…

17:16.599 --> 17:18.800
I'm not really Lady Wei Rao.

17:19.319 --> 17:20.599
My name is A-Chou.

17:21.680 --> 17:24.599
I'm just a servant
who empties chamber pots on the streets.

17:24.680 --> 17:28.560
They found me to marry into
the Lu family in Lady Rao's place.

17:30.000 --> 17:31.000
What…

17:32.600 --> 17:35.120
A… A substitute bride?

17:35.760 --> 17:39.200
How could they do something so reckless?

17:40.280 --> 17:43.000
Absurd. Absolutely absurd…

17:43.080 --> 17:45.160
Dowager Lady, please don't upset yourself.

17:45.240 --> 17:46.800
I come from a humble background.

17:46.880 --> 17:48.400
I'm no one of importance.

17:48.480 --> 17:51.760
But even the lowliest creature
clings to life. I only want to live.

17:54.360 --> 17:55.320
Dowager Lady.

17:58.720 --> 18:01.960
The marriage between our families
was arranged by the Empress Dowager.

18:03.040 --> 18:04.640
If this secret gets out,

18:05.160 --> 18:06.400
the Duke of Ying and Earl
of Cheng'an's families

18:06.480 --> 18:07.760
will become bitter enemies.

18:08.400 --> 18:09.920
The Wei family will be guilty of
deceiving His Majesty.

18:10.000 --> 18:11.440
It's a crime that can never be pardoned.

18:12.120 --> 18:13.720
If we don't want
the whole family executed,

18:14.640 --> 18:17.160
this secret must stay buried.

18:17.680 --> 18:18.920
Not a word can get out.

18:21.680 --> 18:26.560
So I dared
to secure myself some protection.

18:27.880 --> 18:29.520
Protection?

18:30.440 --> 18:34.280
I hid a silk handkerchief
among Lord Lu's belongings.

18:35.760 --> 18:39.240
It explains in detail
how I became the substitute bride.

18:40.560 --> 18:44.520
If she dies in the Wei Residence today,

18:44.600 --> 18:48.080
the Duke's Residence
will send men tomorrow to demand answers.

18:48.160 --> 18:50.880
Sending a lowly servant
as a substitute bride

18:50.960 --> 18:53.600
is an insult to the Lu family

18:53.680 --> 18:56.600
and a grave offense
against the Imperial Family!

18:57.320 --> 19:01.240
The entire household will die with you.

19:01.320 --> 19:03.680
They'll come demanding answers!

19:06.600 --> 19:08.360
I was wrong about her!

19:08.880 --> 19:12.280
That wretched woman
is far more cunning than I thought!

19:12.360 --> 19:13.840
Enough!

19:13.920 --> 19:17.240
You kept indulging her reckless behavior

19:17.320 --> 19:20.640
and nearly got the entire family killed!

19:21.520 --> 19:24.520
Are you satisfied now?

19:26.920 --> 19:28.240
Mother.

19:29.160 --> 19:30.720
She won't reveal the secret, will she?

19:31.720 --> 19:33.720
She's a clever girl.

19:34.320 --> 19:36.080
And she acts decisively.

19:36.960 --> 19:38.920
Didn't the servants say so?

19:39.000 --> 19:42.880
She even managed to fool Lu Zhuo.

19:44.040 --> 19:46.600
As long as you don't push her too far,

19:47.680 --> 19:49.920
she won't risk her own life.

19:51.160 --> 19:53.000
Grandmother only cares about the family.

19:53.520 --> 19:54.720
But what about my future?

19:55.400 --> 20:00.160
There can only be one Lady Wei Rao,

20:00.240 --> 20:02.400
and she is the principal wife
of the Duke's Residence.

20:06.440 --> 20:09.760
What you gave away with your own hands

20:10.360 --> 20:15.120
wasn't just your status
as the Wei family's cherished daughter.

20:15.200 --> 20:20.840
You also gave away
a powerful, high-ranking husband,

20:20.920 --> 20:23.400
and all the wealth and honor

20:23.480 --> 20:25.640
you would've enjoyed
for the rest of your life!

20:35.080 --> 20:36.560
It's fate.

20:37.640 --> 20:39.760
Fate.

20:40.880 --> 20:45.360
I don't want to accept it,
but I have no choice.

20:46.080 --> 20:47.600
And you…

20:49.360 --> 20:50.720
You…

20:52.760 --> 20:56.080
Mother, have mercy!

20:56.160 --> 20:59.080
Please leave your own granddaughter
some way to live! Mother!

21:02.160 --> 21:04.960
We could say she came from Yizhou,

21:05.040 --> 21:06.760
from the Dowager Lady's maternal family.

21:06.840 --> 21:09.480
Since she looks so much like Lady Rao,

21:10.080 --> 21:11.920
she brought the Dowager Lady comfort,

21:12.000 --> 21:15.560
so the Dowager Lady took her
as a god-granddaughter.

21:16.160 --> 21:17.640
As long as we keep the servants in line,

21:17.720 --> 21:21.040
there shouldn't be any trouble.

21:24.640 --> 21:28.000
I lost my head and said things
that hurt you, Grandmother.

21:28.520 --> 21:29.560
I was wrong.

21:30.160 --> 21:31.640
I know I was wrong!

21:32.160 --> 21:34.400
I truly know I was wrong!

21:35.960 --> 21:38.960
Mother! Mother!

21:39.040 --> 21:40.200
Mother.

21:41.280 --> 21:44.240
Never forget the lesson you learned today.

21:44.320 --> 21:47.480
Stay in your room and reflect on
what you've done.

21:47.560 --> 21:50.640
Don't cause any more trouble.

21:55.160 --> 21:56.920
Mother…

22:08.240 --> 22:11.000
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

22:11.080 --> 22:11.920
You may all leave.

22:17.880 --> 22:18.840
Why don't you burn incense anymore?

22:21.360 --> 22:24.880
Before you were married,
you used an incense burner in your room,

22:24.960 --> 22:25.960
and even scented your clothes.

22:26.640 --> 22:29.520
I heard you even had a special
incense cage made for your bedding

22:29.600 --> 22:32.040
and wouldn't sleep
until the bedding was fully scented.

22:35.320 --> 22:36.680
Yet since marrying into my family,

22:37.720 --> 22:39.240
I haven't seen you use one even once.

22:40.400 --> 22:41.680
He's suspicious.

22:42.520 --> 22:45.760
Back home, I was very particular
and never settled for less.

22:46.280 --> 22:48.880
But now I'm married, and you've been ill.

22:49.720 --> 22:52.480
How could I care about
makeup, perfume, or incense?

22:52.560 --> 22:55.920
Besides, incense often contains
medicinal herbs.

22:56.000 --> 22:57.680
I feared it might interfere
with your medicine.

22:57.760 --> 22:59.600
So I stopped using it.

23:00.400 --> 23:01.520
Is your hand better?

23:02.960 --> 23:05.520
Physician Zhao worked wonders.
It's much better.

23:07.400 --> 23:08.400
Qi Zhongkai.

23:13.360 --> 23:15.160
He's the second son
of the Marquis of Pingxi.

23:16.160 --> 23:17.080
We've always been close.

23:17.760 --> 23:20.720
He heard I'd recovered
and wants to hold a banquet for me.

23:20.800 --> 23:22.440
I've been feeling exhausted.

23:23.200 --> 23:24.840
I can't be bothered
with all that ceremony.

23:26.760 --> 23:28.040
Write back and politely decline for me.

24:13.280 --> 24:14.520
What's wrong?

24:15.360 --> 24:19.800
I'm not sure what rank Lord Qi holds
or how I should address him.

24:22.560 --> 24:24.120
He's General of Ningshuo.

24:25.120 --> 24:28.240
But when we write to each other,
I address him by his courtesy name.

24:28.920 --> 24:29.800
Shunqin.

24:32.120 --> 24:32.960
Go ahead.

24:48.800 --> 24:49.720
My Lord.

24:53.400 --> 24:56.320
My Lord, the Dowager Lady
heard you were back.

24:56.400 --> 24:57.440
She wants you to see her at once.

25:03.960 --> 25:05.080
No rush.

25:18.400 --> 25:20.920
SHUN

25:23.200 --> 25:24.840
Judging by her old handwriting,

25:24.920 --> 25:27.440
she must've been hot-tempered,
narrow-minded, and impulsive.

25:27.520 --> 25:28.240
SHUNQIN

25:28.320 --> 25:31.720
Her strokes are softer now,
and lack some strength.

25:31.800 --> 25:32.800
Similar, but not quite.

25:33.800 --> 25:35.480
But her right hand was injured before.

25:37.880 --> 25:38.720
My Lord.

25:39.760 --> 25:42.640
You are a noble lady
who grew up in comfort.

25:44.320 --> 25:45.720
Why do you have calluses

25:47.880 --> 25:49.160
and so many scars on your hands?

25:52.360 --> 25:53.560
Why won't you answer me?

25:58.400 --> 26:00.920
What secret are you hiding from me?

26:06.160 --> 26:07.920
If you're still hiding anything,

26:10.000 --> 26:11.520
I won't forgive you.

26:21.400 --> 26:22.800
Why must you press me so hard?

26:23.320 --> 26:25.240
Don't you know my family background?

26:26.680 --> 26:29.160
My father's family isn't my only family.

26:30.520 --> 26:32.280
There's also my mother's family,
scorned by society.

26:34.240 --> 26:37.400
My maternal grandmother is Lady Shou'an,
His Majesty's former wet nurse.

26:37.480 --> 26:39.200
My own mother…

26:41.320 --> 26:42.160
She…

26:46.400 --> 26:48.520
Grandmother doesn't want me
seeing my mother's family.

26:50.280 --> 26:53.280
But Lady Shou'an
is my maternal grandmother.

26:53.360 --> 26:54.560
How could I not be close to her?

26:55.840 --> 26:59.880
She was born a farm girl
and often grew homesick and depressed.

27:00.440 --> 27:03.720
His Majesty granted her an estate
and farmland outside the capital.

27:04.960 --> 27:06.640
With my wedding approaching,

27:06.720 --> 27:08.400
I didn't know when I'd see her again.

27:08.920 --> 27:10.720
So I often visited her
behind Grandmother's back.

27:11.480 --> 27:14.280
I helped her raise silkworms
and weave cloth.

27:14.880 --> 27:17.160
Sometimes I'd even help with farm work.

27:17.760 --> 27:18.680
As for these scars…

27:22.720 --> 27:23.960
I was just being a busybody.

27:25.760 --> 27:26.600
You…

27:37.000 --> 27:38.720
My Lady knew you weren't sleeping well,

27:38.800 --> 27:41.040
so she dried the herbs herself

27:41.120 --> 27:43.200
and stitched this herbal pillow by hand.

27:43.280 --> 27:46.720
That's how My Lady's hands
ended up with so many cuts.

27:46.800 --> 27:47.880
Stop right there.

27:49.240 --> 27:50.760
What else do you need, My Lord?

27:53.720 --> 27:55.800
Never mind. Leave it here.

27:57.200 --> 27:59.560
The herbs need to be dried again
every three days.

27:59.640 --> 28:00.800
Bring it back after I've replaced them.

28:11.480 --> 28:12.760
Bring me a bamboo basket.

28:44.360 --> 28:46.640
People don't change their true nature.

28:46.720 --> 28:48.880
No matter how beautiful this woman is
or how well she hides it,

28:49.840 --> 28:52.880
never forget how vicious and cruel
she was when she killed.

28:53.640 --> 28:56.200
Don't be fooled by a beautiful monster
in a pretty disguise.

29:00.960 --> 29:02.720
Do not disturb His Lordship
while he's reading.

29:29.240 --> 29:32.240
Bitao, thank you for bringing Lord Lu.

29:32.320 --> 29:33.680
You got me out of a desperate situation.

29:33.760 --> 29:35.120
It was your quick thinking, My Lady,

29:35.200 --> 29:37.000
that got you safely out of
the Wei Residence.

29:37.600 --> 29:40.800
You even thought of
Lady Rao's old scar on her hand.

29:50.520 --> 29:52.200
I have something important to show you.

30:03.600 --> 30:04.440
This…

30:06.040 --> 30:07.920
This is my indenture contract.

30:08.000 --> 30:08.840
BITAO'S INDENTURE CONTRACT

30:09.560 --> 30:10.480
When I was in the room,

30:11.360 --> 30:13.360
I told Old Madam Wei everything.

30:13.920 --> 30:16.840
To appease me, she asked what I wanted.

30:17.440 --> 30:18.760
So I asked her for this.

30:18.840 --> 30:22.520
This is what masters use
to keep servants under their control.

30:24.080 --> 30:27.400
My Lady,
are you really willing to give it to me?

30:41.240 --> 30:43.320
BITAO

30:51.640 --> 30:52.640
There.

30:53.360 --> 30:55.480
No one can control you
with that contract anymore.

31:01.600 --> 31:02.520
Get up.

31:10.000 --> 31:11.600
SUBSTITUTION BRIDE, A DEFIED DECREE
THE HANDKERCHIEF STANDS AS PROOF

31:13.760 --> 31:15.440
My Lady, you know how to read?

31:16.240 --> 31:17.960
People from all walks of life
lived in our tenement.

31:18.920 --> 31:20.640
Literate storytellers,

31:21.240 --> 31:24.600
aging courtesans,
concubines and illegitimate sons

31:25.120 --> 31:26.520
cast out after the master
of the house died.

31:26.600 --> 31:28.360
I begged each one of them.

31:28.920 --> 31:30.880
Some kind souls would
teach me a thing or two.

31:31.680 --> 31:33.960
With no pen or ink,
I wrote with twigs in sand.

31:34.560 --> 31:36.680
After ten years,
I learned to read most things.

31:37.760 --> 31:38.840
To keep anyone from finding out,

31:40.000 --> 31:42.520
I'd already practiced
copying Lady Rao's handwriting.

31:43.120 --> 31:45.920
After all that, My Lady,
you finally made it through.

31:47.280 --> 31:48.360
Silly girl.

31:51.720 --> 31:53.600
Even if Old Madam Wei lets me stay,

31:55.000 --> 31:58.360
Lady Wei Rao won't let this go.

31:59.560 --> 32:01.600
Lu Zhuo despises me,

32:01.680 --> 32:04.320
and the Lu family is a powerful clan
with too many eyes and ears.

32:04.840 --> 32:08.960
One wrong move,
and if anyone sees through me,

32:09.960 --> 32:11.320
I'll be the first to lose my head.

32:12.320 --> 32:13.640
Then what will you do, My Lady?

32:20.400 --> 32:21.680
No matter what,

32:24.400 --> 32:25.800
I have to secure my place

32:27.200 --> 32:28.640
in the Lu family.

32:43.120 --> 32:44.160
Madam.

32:50.800 --> 32:53.400
It seems you've won her trust.

32:54.240 --> 32:56.840
The fastest way to gain someone's trust

32:56.920 --> 32:59.480
is to share a secret
that dare not see the light.

33:00.160 --> 33:02.040
It's a shame about Governess Wu.

33:02.760 --> 33:06.200
Why pity such a fool?

33:07.120 --> 33:09.640
You handled this very well.

33:10.400 --> 33:12.200
What should I do next?

33:12.840 --> 33:14.080
Please instruct me, Madam.

33:15.960 --> 33:20.560
Just stay by her side and do nothing.

33:21.760 --> 33:23.200
When I need you,

33:23.800 --> 33:25.720
I'll make the arrangements.

33:28.160 --> 33:29.280
No matter what,

33:30.000 --> 33:31.440
I'll help you.

33:45.480 --> 33:46.480
I've found out everything.

33:47.080 --> 33:49.880
The Dowager Lady has trouble chewing
and loves golden osmanthus.

33:50.640 --> 33:53.840
These osmanthus cakes you made
are sure to please her.

33:59.160 --> 34:00.480
Rao.

34:00.560 --> 34:01.600
Have you lost your mind too?

34:01.680 --> 34:03.680
Why bow to that vicious woman?

34:07.760 --> 34:08.960
What?

34:09.040 --> 34:11.159
Have you gone mad, Changning?

34:11.239 --> 34:12.800
How dare you insult me!

34:12.880 --> 34:15.880
A noble lady who won't even greet
her elder sister-in-law,

34:16.400 --> 34:18.520
but calls her a vicious woman to her face?

34:19.719 --> 34:22.040
Either you've suddenly gone mad,
or no one ever taught you manners.

34:22.960 --> 34:24.639
Changhui seems perfectly well-mannered.

34:25.159 --> 34:26.760
So the problem must be you.

34:27.360 --> 34:28.760
You vicious witch!

34:28.840 --> 34:31.960
Pretty on the outside,
but rotten to the core!

34:32.040 --> 34:34.000
You were jealous of Hualou's
beauty and talent,

34:34.080 --> 34:36.440
so you shoved her down,
and nearly killed her!

34:37.520 --> 34:41.280
Keep shouting,
and I'll tell Grandmother and Aunt.

34:41.880 --> 34:44.639
Then let's see how you survive
in the Lu family.

34:45.360 --> 34:47.199
Sister, please stop.

34:48.199 --> 34:50.239
Why would I push her for no reason?

34:50.320 --> 34:53.239
Wasn't it because Hualou
had feelings for our cousin?

34:53.320 --> 34:55.600
-Shh…
-So you got jealous and tried to kill her!

34:56.840 --> 35:00.200
So Lady Xie has feelings for my husband.

35:00.280 --> 35:01.520
Wei Rao!

35:02.800 --> 35:03.680
-My Lady!
-Rao!

35:03.760 --> 35:05.040
-Wei Rao! Let go!
-Rao!

35:05.120 --> 35:06.200
Wei Rao, let go!

35:12.560 --> 35:13.640
Wei Rao!

35:17.120 --> 35:18.160
Watch out!

35:26.120 --> 35:27.040
Lu Changning.

35:28.040 --> 35:29.120
Your behavior is disgraceful.

35:29.200 --> 35:30.760
Go copy the family rules 100 times!

35:31.360 --> 35:32.640
Brother!

35:32.720 --> 35:34.280
You're still defending that vicious woman?

35:34.360 --> 35:35.840
She clearly tried to hurt Hualou!

35:35.920 --> 35:38.440
I'm punishing you for your disrespect
and forgetting your place.

35:39.080 --> 35:40.320
Go kneel in the ancestral hall
for two more hours.

35:40.400 --> 35:41.640
Brother!

35:41.720 --> 35:44.600
Anyone who dares plead for her
can kneel with her!

35:46.840 --> 35:49.440
You vicious fraud!

35:50.080 --> 35:51.280
Sooner or later,
I'll expose you for what you are!

36:01.960 --> 36:03.200
What are you looking for?

36:04.480 --> 36:06.520
-Your fox tail.
-Shunqin.

36:07.640 --> 36:09.400
Enough with the fooling around.

36:09.920 --> 36:11.200
Weren't we here to talk business?

36:11.720 --> 36:12.920
Come over here now.

36:14.920 --> 36:16.400
We're all family here.
No need to send the ladies away.

36:16.920 --> 36:17.840
Sister-in-law, join us.

36:32.920 --> 36:34.000
These are all for me?

36:34.080 --> 36:35.920
Everything you picked
at the shop yesterday.

36:36.440 --> 36:37.800
I had them delivered.

36:38.680 --> 36:39.520
Thank you, My Lord.

36:41.680 --> 36:44.400
And thank you, General Qi,
for bringing them yourself.

36:59.200 --> 37:00.320
Everything's arranged?

37:01.120 --> 37:02.160
Don't worry.

37:02.840 --> 37:06.600
I recovered so quickly
thanks to Rao's devoted care.

37:08.560 --> 37:10.080
The Qixi Festival is in two days.

37:10.160 --> 37:11.560
The streets will be lively.

37:12.680 --> 37:13.640
I'll take you out.

37:17.920 --> 37:19.840
Grandmother ordered it. I can't disobey.

37:20.960 --> 37:22.280
You should get ready too.

37:23.120 --> 37:25.320
I'm glad you care, My Lord.

37:32.840 --> 37:34.720
They should die! All of them!

37:40.840 --> 37:41.840
Rao!

37:43.040 --> 37:44.200
Rao!

37:44.280 --> 37:45.440
Let me see.

37:45.520 --> 37:46.560
Did you hurt yourself?

37:46.640 --> 37:49.080
Aunt Heng'e, you have to help me.

37:50.280 --> 37:52.960
You want me to get you out?

37:53.520 --> 37:54.800
What are you planning?

37:56.280 --> 37:57.920
Grandmother thinks
if she keeps me locked up,

37:58.000 --> 37:59.520
there's nothing I can do?

38:00.160 --> 38:05.920
Unless that wretch
hides in the Duke's Residence forever,

38:06.680 --> 38:08.000
the moment she steps out,

38:09.920 --> 38:14.840
I'll send her right back
where she came from!

38:19.920 --> 38:22.960
SEVENTH DAY OF THE SEVENTH MONTH

38:35.040 --> 38:36.480
Doesn't this puppet look like Lu Zhuo?

38:36.560 --> 38:37.400
Looks like you.

38:42.520 --> 38:43.400
I know this area well.

38:43.920 --> 38:47.080
See? That fire performer
isn't even a tenth as good as me.

38:51.760 --> 38:53.040
There's a shop ahead
with delicious festival pastries.

38:53.120 --> 38:54.280
QIXI FESTIVAL PASTRY

38:54.360 --> 38:55.560
Miss, take a look.
Which ones would you like?

38:55.640 --> 38:57.160
I'll wrap them up for you.

38:57.240 --> 38:58.080
They look so fresh.

38:58.160 --> 38:59.920
They were all made today.

39:00.000 --> 39:01.800
This one and this one.

39:01.880 --> 39:02.720
Of course.

39:05.040 --> 39:06.200
Here you are, Miss.

39:06.720 --> 39:07.880
Tonight, let me wish you good fortune.

39:08.520 --> 39:11.360
May these festival pastries
bless you with even greater wit and skill.

39:12.960 --> 39:13.840
Thank you, General Qi.

39:15.920 --> 39:17.440
What are you dawdling for?

39:17.520 --> 39:18.680
Aren't you going to
toss the fortune needle?

39:19.440 --> 39:20.600
It's just ahead.

39:23.320 --> 39:25.000
Zhuo, don't you have something
important to do?

39:25.080 --> 39:26.160
Go take care of it.

39:30.880 --> 39:31.920
Keep an eye on her.

39:40.440 --> 39:41.440
Come take a look.

39:41.960 --> 39:43.240
Fresh festival pastries.

39:43.760 --> 39:45.520
-Come take a look.
-You're not Wei Rao at all.

39:52.600 --> 39:54.440
Lu Zhuo went to war at 13.

39:54.520 --> 39:56.280
What would he know
about telling women apart?

39:57.160 --> 39:59.680
But I grew up
with 15 or 16 female cousins.

40:00.320 --> 40:02.400
I can spot your flaws easily.

40:09.080 --> 40:09.920
I'm listening.

40:10.760 --> 40:12.440
A pampered beauty like her
has snow-white skin.

40:12.520 --> 40:13.640
But you…

40:15.320 --> 40:17.640
Your eyes may be beautiful,
but your complexion gives you away.

40:18.280 --> 40:20.200
The real Wei Rao
has arched brows and piercing eyes,

40:20.280 --> 40:21.600
the look of someone proud and headstrong.

40:22.280 --> 40:24.320
Your eyes are lively and sharp,

40:24.400 --> 40:25.640
the look of someone clever and cunning.

40:26.360 --> 40:28.560
The real Wei Rao
moves with delicate grace.

40:28.640 --> 40:30.280
But your steps are firm and steady.

40:31.520 --> 40:33.560
You're clearly not the same person.

41:04.920 --> 41:07.480
Then look at my hand.
How is it different from hers?

41:12.280 --> 41:13.120
What are you doing?

41:13.200 --> 41:16.720
My husband considers you
a trusted comrade, a sworn brother.

41:16.800 --> 41:18.880
Yet while he's away,
you dare speak so rudely to his wife!

41:19.480 --> 41:21.360
You're not the only one
who can read faces.

41:21.880 --> 41:23.240
I can too!

41:24.800 --> 41:26.800
Your eyes are deep-set and hollow,
your brows slant and your eyes leer.

41:26.880 --> 41:28.760
You have the hungry stare of a lecher!

41:29.480 --> 41:31.880
So you're a shameless scoundrel,

41:31.960 --> 41:34.320
two-faced and treacherous,
trading honor for a woman's favor.

41:34.400 --> 41:35.240
How lecherous!

41:35.320 --> 41:37.480
How dare you stare at
your sister-in-law's figure?

41:37.560 --> 41:38.720
Have you no shame?

41:38.800 --> 41:40.360
You even dare flirt
with your sister-in-law?

41:40.440 --> 41:41.520
Absolutely shameless!

41:41.600 --> 41:44.760
Nonsense! I'm this handsome.
How are my brows and eyes crooked?

41:44.840 --> 41:45.720
You…

41:46.760 --> 41:48.880
Help! Someone's been killed
on East Street!

41:48.960 --> 41:50.680
Murder! Call the authorities!

41:51.200 --> 41:52.520
Just as expected.

41:53.200 --> 41:55.080
Lord Lu is injured. I need to help him.

41:55.600 --> 41:56.720
Protect Lady Lu.

42:52.240 --> 42:53.440
Retreat! Hurry!

42:58.800 --> 42:59.800
I've waited long enough for you.

42:59.880 --> 43:01.320
Where do you think you're going?

43:06.480 --> 43:07.680
Where is she?

43:07.760 --> 43:09.000
Didn't I tell you to watch her?

43:12.560 --> 43:13.640
Search over there.

43:21.800 --> 43:23.200
My Lady, they're gone.

43:30.440 --> 43:32.880
Qi Zhongkai is trouble too.

43:33.520 --> 43:36.840
I'll have to be even more careful
when dealing with him.

43:36.920 --> 43:38.640
Come take a look!

43:39.160 --> 43:40.800
Beautiful floating lanterns!

43:40.880 --> 43:41.800
My Lady, look.

43:41.880 --> 43:43.720
People are making wishes
with lanterns over there.

43:43.800 --> 43:46.520
-Come take a look!
-What a lively scene.

43:46.600 --> 43:48.720
Floating lanterns! Come see!

43:49.320 --> 43:51.240
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

43:51.320 --> 43:52.280
He's spitting fire!

43:52.360 --> 43:53.200
One more!

43:53.280 --> 43:55.200
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

43:55.280 --> 43:57.640
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

43:58.160 --> 43:59.920
Nothing for me here.

44:00.760 --> 44:01.880
Sure!

44:08.920 --> 44:13.120
Heaven above,
please keep Mother and Hongxian safe.

44:13.200 --> 44:14.600
Move! Get out of my way!

44:15.120 --> 44:16.320
-Move!
-Hurry!

44:16.400 --> 44:18.400
-My Lady!
-Everyone down there, get out!

44:19.040 --> 44:20.000
Who is that?

44:20.080 --> 44:21.160
Move!

44:25.120 --> 44:25.960
Get out!

44:26.600 --> 44:27.760
Move, now!

44:29.680 --> 44:31.840
Lady Rao! Lady Rao!

44:31.920 --> 44:32.920
-You can't do this!
-How dare you betray me!

44:33.000 --> 44:33.880
Bitao!

44:37.520 --> 44:39.400
Grab that wretched woman!

44:52.480 --> 44:54.520
Aren't you so clever?

44:54.600 --> 44:56.040
Don't you always have a trick
up your sleeve?

44:56.640 --> 44:57.800
You even fooled Grandmother
into believing you

44:57.880 --> 44:59.360
and locking me inside.

44:59.440 --> 45:00.480
You thought you could replace me

45:00.560 --> 45:02.560
and become the daughter-in-law
of the Duke's Residence?

45:02.640 --> 45:03.960
Dream on!

45:05.400 --> 45:08.040
If Lu Zhuo learns the wife he married

45:08.120 --> 45:11.160
is nothing but a filthy, lowborn
chamber-pot woman,

45:11.240 --> 45:12.520
he'll be sick to death!

45:13.200 --> 45:16.800
You fraud, stealing another woman's place!
Heaven made you lowborn.

45:16.880 --> 45:20.200
You should've known your place
and stayed in the gutter your whole life!

45:20.280 --> 45:22.840
You tried to steal a life
that was never yours.

45:22.920 --> 45:24.640
This is what you get!

45:25.160 --> 45:27.440
Die! Just die!

45:44.520 --> 45:45.400
She's not breathing.

46:51.000 --> 46:52.200
Look! What's happening over there?

46:52.280 --> 46:53.680
What happened?

46:53.760 --> 46:55.080
Did someone fall into the water?

46:56.120 --> 46:57.080
Lady Rao!

46:57.640 --> 46:58.760
Hurry! Hurry!

46:58.840 --> 46:59.680
Quick!

47:03.000 --> 47:04.200
-Over there!
-Hurry up!

47:04.280 --> 47:05.680
Hurry!

47:05.760 --> 47:06.760
Someone save her!

47:06.840 --> 47:08.160
You're noble! You're so important!

47:08.760 --> 47:10.240
Heaven gave you so much,

47:10.320 --> 47:11.680
yet you threw it all away!

47:11.760 --> 47:13.160
Now you want it back?

47:13.240 --> 47:14.840
You don't get to have it both ways!

47:14.920 --> 47:15.840
Want to see who wins?

47:15.920 --> 47:18.720
Me, who grew up fighting
through the gutter,

47:18.800 --> 47:20.680
or you, who grew up surrounded by luxury?

47:20.760 --> 47:22.280
Let's see which of us is harder to kill!

47:36.120 --> 47:39.040
Help! Somebody help!

47:39.120 --> 47:40.320
-My Lady!
-By the river!

47:40.400 --> 47:41.320
-My Lord!
-Somebody help!

47:41.400 --> 47:42.440
-My Lord!
-Murder!

47:43.640 --> 47:46.960
My Lord! Help! My Lord!

47:47.480 --> 47:48.520
My Lady!

47:50.720 --> 47:51.680
Don't say a word.

47:51.760 --> 47:54.000
If he finds out, we're both dead.

48:03.600 --> 48:05.160
-Over there.
-Be careful!

48:05.760 --> 48:06.800
Come on! Catch that!

48:08.360 --> 48:10.360
Here! Can you reach it?

48:11.960 --> 48:13.440
Grab on!

48:15.480 --> 48:16.520
Careful.

48:17.320 --> 48:18.400
Come on!

48:19.400 --> 48:20.440
My Lady.

48:22.600 --> 48:23.880
What happened?

48:25.800 --> 48:27.920
M-My Lady was here
releasing a lantern and praying

48:28.000 --> 48:29.160
when she was attacked by robbers.

48:29.240 --> 48:30.600
They weren't satisfied
with stealing her valuables.

48:30.680 --> 48:31.800
They tried to abduct My Lady too.

48:31.880 --> 48:34.440
But when they heard you were coming,
they got scared and fled.

48:34.520 --> 48:36.960
Have the city guards search
the entire city. Let's get back first.

48:37.760 --> 48:39.760
You're still injured. Let me.

48:40.680 --> 48:41.960
Clear the way!

48:51.400 --> 48:52.640
Make way! Make way!

51:10.760 --> 51:13.360
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW

51:13.360 --> 51:14.360
MkvDrama.net
